WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.202
-Every morning when we come in,
we start our day

00:00:02.202 --> 00:00:04.871 align:start size:94% position:6%
with a production meeting,
and that is a rundown

00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:07.841 align:start size:94% position:6%
of what will be happening on
the show that night.

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:10.410 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, as usual,
one of my writers, Mike,

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:13.913 align:start size:94% position:6%
completely derailed
that meeting.

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:14.447 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Take a look.

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:17.117
-Yeah, I thought that desk piece
turned out great, Amber.

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:19.119 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, we got
a very busy day today.

00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:21.554 align:start size:94% position:6%
Let's try to run through this
as quickly as possible.

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:23.790 align:start size:94% position:6%
Mike, I'm specifically
talking to you.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:27.293 align:start size:94% position:6%
Please no interruptions
today, all right?

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:28.395 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-Thank you very much.

00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:31.097 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, for guests tonight,
we got Jeff Goldblum.

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:32.332 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then we'll talk
to Dick Cavett.

00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:34.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, in Act 6, we are going to
do a cooking segment.

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:38.138 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, also, my cousin "Skiz"
is on the show.

00:00:38.138 --> 00:00:39.039 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-What?

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:40.373 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
He's gonna do vape tricks.

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:42.909 size:84% position:42%
Mike, you can't just
book guests on the show

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:44.477 size:84% position:42% line:92%
without telling anyone.

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:45.211 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I did tell you.

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:47.547 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I would never have
agreed to that.

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:48.214 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-On Monday, I said,

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:50.383
"My cousin Skiz is coming
to the show this week,"

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:51.918 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you said,
"That's awesome, Mike."

00:00:51.918 --> 00:00:53.386 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I specifically remember,
because up until then,

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:55.822 align:start size:94% position:6%
you've never said, "This is
awesome, Mike" about anything.

00:00:55.822 --> 00:00:58.625 size:84% position:42%
-I thought you meant
he was coming to watch.

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:01.694 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh. He wouldn't do that.
He hates this show.

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:05.265 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, that reminds me -- no
Trump jokes today.

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:06.733 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Skiz is a fan.

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:09.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Are you serious?
-Well, not of his politics.

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:10.303 align:start size:94% position:6%
He just thinks
he's a good husband.

00:01:10.303 --> 00:01:14.674
-You invited a Trump fan on this
show to do vape tricks?

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:17.277 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The man gave me
a kidney, Reece.

00:01:17.277 --> 00:01:19.212 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He did?
-Yeah.

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:20.313 line:92%
But I didn't even ask for it.

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:22.549 align:start size:94% position:6%
He just showed up one day
with an Igloo cooler

00:01:22.549 --> 00:01:24.284 line:92%
and asked me to stash it.

00:01:24.284 --> 00:01:26.386 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How do you
get to work every day?

00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:28.488 line:92%
Does an adult drop you off?

00:01:28.488 --> 00:01:31.658 size:84% position:42% line:92%
