00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:33.426 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm sorry.
Did that sound sarcastic?

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:34.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
I meant, no.
A child drives me.

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:37.730
-Well, Mike, we can't have
a four guests on the show.

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:38.498 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'm sorry.

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:39.966 line:92%
-Well, then one of us is gonna

00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:41.234 line:92%
have to deliver the bad news.

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:43.770 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You! You're the only one
who knows him.

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:45.538 line:92%
-I don't know Jeff Goldblum.

00:01:45.538 --> 00:01:48.041 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We're not bumping
Jeff Goldblum.

00:01:48.041 --> 00:01:51.611 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Aww! Poor Dick Cavett.
-I have a question.

00:01:51.611 --> 00:01:52.612 line:92%
-Yes, Skiz is circumcised.

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:55.782 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That is not even in
the ballpark of my question.

00:01:55.782 --> 00:01:59.619 size:84% position:42%
What vape tricks does
this boy actually know?

00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:02.522
-Currently, none, but he said
he would learn some by tonight.

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:04.891 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He doesn't even know
any vape tricks?

00:02:04.891 --> 00:02:08.194
-Uh, neither does Jeff Goldblum,
and you still booked him.

00:02:08.194 --> 00:02:10.196 line:92%
God, what is his problem today?

00:02:10.196 --> 00:02:12.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
-When I first met you,
I assumed this was

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:14.801 line:92%
some sort of Batkid scenario,

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:19.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
but it's been a few years now,
and you're still here.

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:22.675 size:78% position:39%
-Okay. I know I don't
speak up much here.

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:23.209 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, my God.

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:25.545 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's literally
the only thing you do here.

00:02:25.545 --> 00:02:28.047 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But I'm feeling
very attacked right now,

00:02:28.047 --> 00:02:29.849 align:start size:94% position:6%
